{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"flutter-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Flutter Snippets","description":"Widgets, layouts, navigation, state, async builders and forms for Flutter and Dart.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Dart","path":"snippets/dart.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/dart.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Stateless widget\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fstless\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} extends StatelessWidget {\",\n      \"  const ${1:Name}({super.key});\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  @override\",\n      \"  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\",\n      \"    return ${2:const Placeholder()};\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A StatelessWidget\"\n  },\n  \"Stateful widget\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fstful\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} extends StatefulWidget {\",\n      \"  const ${1:Name}({super.key});\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  @override\",\n      \"  State<${1:Name}> createState() => _${1:Name}State();\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"class _${1:Name}State extends State<${1:Name}> {\",\n      \"  @override\",\n      \"  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\",\n      \"    return ${2:const Placeholder()};\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A StatefulWidget\"\n  },\n  \"Scaffold\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fscaffold\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Scaffold(\",\n      \"  appBar: AppBar(title: const Text('${1:Title}')),\",\n      \"  body: ${2:const Center(child: Text('Hello'))},\",\n      \"  floatingActionButton: FloatingActionButton(\",\n      \"    onPressed: () {},\",\n      \"    child: const Icon(Icons.add),\",\n      \"  ),\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Scaffold\"\n  },\n  \"Column\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fcol\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Column(\",\n      \"  crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.${1:start},\",\n      \"  children: [\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"  ],\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Column\"\n  },\n  \"Row\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"frow\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Row(\",\n      \"  mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.${1:spaceBetween},\",\n      \"  children: [\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"  ],\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Row\"\n  },\n  \"Padding\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fpad\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Padding(\",\n      \"  padding: const EdgeInsets.all(${1:16}),\",\n      \"  child: ${2:child},\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Padding\"\n  },\n  \"ListView builder\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"flist\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"ListView.builder(\",\n      \"  itemCount: ${1:items}.length,\",\n      \"  itemBuilder: (context, index) {\",\n      \"    final item = ${1:items}[index];\",\n      \"    return ListTile(title: Text(${2:item.name}));\",\n      \"  },\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"ListView.builder\"\n  },\n  \"Future builder\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ffuture\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"FutureBuilder<${1:String}>(\",\n      \"  future: ${2:future},\",\n      \"  builder: (context, snapshot) {\",\n      \"    if (snapshot.connectionState != ConnectionState.done) {\",\n      \"      return const CircularProgressIndicator();\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"    if (snapshot.hasError) return Text('${snapshot.error}');\",\n      \"    return Text(snapshot.data ?? '');\",\n      \"  },\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"FutureBuilder\"\n  },\n  \"Navigator push\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fpush\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Navigator.of(context).push(\",\n      \"  MaterialPageRoute(builder: (_) => const ${1:NextPage}()),\",\n      \");\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Navigator.push\"\n  },\n  \"Set state\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fset\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"setState(() {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"setState\"\n  },\n  \"Text field\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ftext\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"TextField(\",\n      \"  controller: ${1:controller},\",\n      \"  decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: '${2:Label}'),\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A TextField\"\n  },\n  \"Elevated button\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fbtn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"ElevatedButton(\",\n      \"  onPressed: ${1:() {}},\",\n      \"  child: const Text('${2:Press}'),\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An ElevatedButton\"\n  },\n  \"Form\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Form(\",\n      \"  key: _formKey,\",\n      \"  child: TextFormField(\",\n      \"    validator: (v) => (v == null || v.isEmpty) ? 'Required' : null,\",\n      \"  ),\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Form with a validator\"\n  },\n  \"Init state\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"finit\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@override\",\n      \"void initState() {\",\n      \"  super.initState();\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"@override\",\n      \"void dispose() {\",\n      \"  super.dispose();\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"initState and dispose\"\n  },\n  \"Theme color\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ftheme\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Theme.of(context).colorScheme.${1:primary}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Theme colors\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Flutter Snippets\n\nWidgets, layouts, navigation, state, async builders and forms for Flutter and Dart.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 15 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Dart | `fstless` | A StatelessWidget |\n| Dart | `fstful` | A StatefulWidget |\n| Dart | `fscaffold` | A Scaffold |\n| Dart | `fcol` | A Column |\n| Dart | `frow` | A Row |\n| Dart | `fpad` | Padding |\n| Dart | `flist` | ListView.builder |\n| Dart | `ffuture` | FutureBuilder |\n| Dart | `fpush` | Navigator.push |\n| Dart | `fset` | setState |\n| Dart | `ftext` | A TextField |\n| Dart | `fbtn` | An ElevatedButton |\n| Dart | `fform` | A Form with a validator |\n| Dart | `finit` | initState and dispose |\n| Dart | `ftheme` | Theme colors |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}